+    was trained against the bf16 target, and acceptance length measures how closely the target still
+    agrees with it. On Qwen3-4B the 16a4w target gives AL ~1.65 where the GPU q4_0 target gives 2.79,
+    and calibration size was ruled out as the cause, which leaves the 4-bit weights. This recipe
+    trades roughly 2x the .pte size for that.
