+class Qwen3_DFlashDraftQuantRecipe(StaticLLMQuantRecipe):
+    """8-bit weights, histogram activation ranges.
+
+    The activation ranges are too narrow, not too wide. See MarginMinMaxObserver for the evidence.
+
+    Weights are not the problem: per-channel 8-bit fake quantisation alone scores 0.9976 and 6 of 8,
+    and bypassing every per-tensor activation quantiser in the exported graph reproduces exactly
+    that. The loss is clipping on layer 0's attention path, which MarginMinMaxObserver fixes.
